Dobrý deň,

Vendor offboarding (PROC-VOF)

Issuer: Moser Slovakia s. r. o. · IČO 47 556 210 · Twin City C, Mlynské nivy 12, 821 09 Bratislava

Effective: 2 May 2026  
Owner: Procurement, Moser Slovakia s. r. o.

When a vendor engagement ends, all access is revoked within 24 hours. IT collects tokens, VPN profiles and repository invitations, and HR closes the building card at the Bratislava site. Offboarding is not optional because "we might rehire them next quarter".

Personal data processed by the vendor is returned or deleted under the data processing agreement, as required by GDPR and the Personal Data Protection Act (zákon č. 18/2018 Z. z.).

The similarly named vendor onboarding policy must never be used as a reason to keep access open.

